{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"generateTID"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A new ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tid"},{"text":" Record Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"According to the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/atproto.com\/specs\/record-key#record-key-type-tid","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tid"},{"type":"text","text":" Record Key consists of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a 64-bit integer, in the big-endian byte order. : "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UInt64"},{"type":"text","text":" is encoded in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"base32-sortable"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is a 13 ASCII character that consists of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"234567abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz"},{"type":"text","text":" with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"padding. The specification also requires that the number never decreases: it must"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"always increase."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A specific layout for ","type":"text"},{"code":"UInt64","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" are as follows:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Bit 0: ","type":"text"},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bits 1–54: The timestamp in microseconds since UNIX epoch."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bits 55–64: The “clock identifier.”"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The “clock identifier” is a 10-bit random number between "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1024"},{"type":"text","text":", which reduces the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chance of a collision between two Record Keys. However, it’s important to note that this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"guarantee"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that no two Record Keys are alike."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/atprotokit\/recordkeymanager\/generatetid()"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"generateTID","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/MasterJ93\/ATProtoKit\/tree\/main\/Sources\/ATProtoKit\/Utilities\/ATProtoIdentifiers\/RecordKeyManager.swift#L50","fileName":"RecordKeyManager.swift"},"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"ATProtoKit"}],"externalID":"s:10ATProtoKit16RecordKeyManagerV11generateTIDSSyF","title":"generateTID()","symbolKind":"method"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ATProtoKit\/documentation\/ATProtoKit","doc:\/\/ATProtoKit\/documentation\/ATProtoKit\/RecordKeyManager"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Creates a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tid"},{"text":" (Timestamp Identifier) Record Key.","type":"text"}],"identifie